<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds end easier after calm session.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds end easier after calm session.</headline>
<text>
<p>1724 GMT - Portuguese bonds ended easier after a calm session. Yield spreads against Bunds widened slightly.</p>
<p>*Sept 97 futures down 0.09 pts to 110.12</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash (OTC) 101.80 (101.95), yld 6.36 (6.34)</p>
<p>*Spread vs 10-yr cash Bund 70 bps vs 66 bps</p>
</text>
